+	* sysdeps/unix/sysv/linux/sparc/bits/typesizes.h: New file.
+
+2003-03-24  Daniel Jacobowitz  <drow@mvista.com>
+
+	* sysdeps/unix/sysv/linux/arm/sysdep-cancel.h
