+2003-03-21  Daniel Jacobowitz  <drow@mvista.com>
+
+	* sysdeps/unix/sysv/linux/arm/sysdep-cancel.h
+	(SINGLE_THREAD_P_PIC): Use "reg" instead of "lr".
